<div class="faq home-faq">
  <details data-q="chatgpt"><summary>Why not just use ChatGPT?</summary><p>ChatGPT doesn't know your roadmap. Eli's Playbook works from your assessment, your 30-day roadmap, and Eli's playbooks and calculators, so its answers fit where you are this week. And there's a real founder behind it.</p></details>
  <details data-q="money"><summary>I don't have money.</summary><p>Good news: your first business can cost $0. The free plan is free, and this week's moves (pick one idea, talk to people who have the problem) cost nothing.</p></details>
  <details data-q="income"><summary>Will I make money?</summary><p>We can't promise that, and anyone who does is selling you something. 127 gives you the plan and the tools. The work is yours. <a class="link" href="/earnings-disclaimer">Earnings disclaimer</a></p></details>
  <details data-q="cancel"><summary>Can I cancel?</summary><p>Yes. Cancel online anytime from Billing. No call or email needed. You keep access to the end of the month you paid for.</p></details>
  <details data-q="faith"><summary>Is this religious?</summary><p>127 is named for Psalm 127, and faith is Eli's foundation. It's offered, never required. Everyone who wants to build with purpose is welcome.</p></details>
